Project Title: Windows Flush Domain Name Server 

Problem: User reports IP address could not be found .

Steps Taken:
1. Testing to see if DNS working at all 
2. Reset the network stack 
3. Check to see if the Wi-Fi Driver is updated.
4.Restart the PC

Root Cause: Outdated IPs 
Solution: Flush DNS Cache
Outcome: User able to have connection to the internet again . 

Tools Used: Command prompt, Device manager 

